					"content": "我感觉…这里面有我需要的信息…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620403,
					"content": "咦？不是终端也可以吗？这东西看起来是自然产生的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620404,
					"content": "不…它是人工制造的…我感觉到了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620405,
					"content": "那…那你小心一点啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620406,
					"content": "啊…果然…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620407,
					"content": "这是一个叫做…卢沙里姆的学者制造出的能量体…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620408,
					"content": "卢沙里姆是谁？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620409,
					"content": "是乌吉恩和玛歌的学生…应该也是…在终端中写下留言的人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620410,
					"content": "这片月海…曾经其实是…卢沙里姆的月幕实验所。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620411,
					"content": "月幕实验所？那又是什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620412,
					"content": "是一个…藏起月亮的伟大工程。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620413,
					"content": "藏起月亮？天呢，这些家伙真是人人…真是龙龙有梦想啊！这种事要怎么办到啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620414,
					"content": "虽然原理不清楚…但好像和他的老师乌吉恩有关…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620415,
					"content": "卢沙里姆成功地实验过微型月幕…就应用在乌吉恩圈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620416,
					"content": "哦，我想起来了！乌吉恩圈从外面看很苍凉，进到里面却是另一个样子！就是月幕的作用吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620417,
					"content": "没错…微型月幕的成功…推动月幕工程进入了下一个阶段…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620418,
					"content": "一座巨大的月幕发生器…在这里建立了…它能遮蔽整个月亮…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620419,
					"content": "可现在月亮并没有被藏起来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620420
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620420,
					"content": "因为就在月幕成形的前夕…一位天外而来的存在戳破了它。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620421,
					"content": "装置失控…实验所发生爆炸…一切都化为乌有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620422,
					"content": "只有地下深处…可能还残留着些许痕迹。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620423,
					"content": "等等…天外而来的存在？！难道是那一位？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620424,
					"content": "高天的主宰…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620425,
					"content": "那个存在的降临，没有人预料到。但它的到来，却改变了一切…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620426,
					"content": "在卢沙里姆的设计中…月幕工程是望月者计划的重要环节…却被迫中止了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620427,
					"content": "那望月者计划究竟是什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620428,
					"content": "小心！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥伦比娅"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620429,
					"content": "糟了！乌吉在下面！快躲开！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
